-**Read [BUG-SWEEP-1.7.1.md](BUG-SWEEP-1.7.1.md) for reproduced bugs, fixes, raw test logs and remaining limitations.** This update fixes sync/date races, corrected-photo meal handling, stale maintenance history, failed-pause behavior and server/backup validation. Schema remains 6.
+**Read [BUG-SWEEP-1.7.2.md](BUG-SWEEP-1.7.2.md) for the second audit, regressions, raw test logs and remaining limitations.** This update bounds the actual HTTP client, enforces an overall request deadline, fixes activity opt-in/pause handling, preserves unchanged verified meals, stabilizes diary keys across display calendars, and prevents malformed step totals from crashing the routine summary. Schema remains 6; all 1.7.1 fixes are retained.
 
